---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Who we protect</span>
<h1>For importers &amp; wholesalers: container-level certainty on every India order</h1>
<p class="lead">Wholesale margins don't survive rejected containers. We put the same inspection discipline on your fifth container as your first—fixed fees, 24-hour reports, and a balance-against-passed-PSI clause that keeps factories planning quality.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><h2 class="vh">How we protect importers</h2><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Protected Container</h3><p>PSI + Container Loading Supervision on every shipment—the repeat-order standard.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Supplier Verification</h3><p>Every new source verified before the first deposit moves.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/production-monitoring-india/"><h3>Monitoring for long runs</h3><p>Weekly eyes on production when orders span multiple months.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><p class="prose rv">Tell us your product, supplier status and destination market — we'll recommend the right sequence of services and a fixed quote within 2 hours. Every engagement is buyer-paid under our Independence Charter: we take nothing from factories, ever.</p></div></section>
<AudienceLinks current="importers" />
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
